Installed drupal/recreate_block_content v3.0.1 + exported config/sync updates.

MODULE INSTALL:
- composer require drupal/recreate_block_content (v3.0.1 installed)
- drush en recreate_block_content -y
- Added to config/sync/core.extension.yml

MODULE MECHANISM:
- No drush commands, no config, no UI settings.
- Works via hook_rebuild() which fires during drush deploy/cim.
- Scans config.manager->findMissingContentDependencies() and creates placeholder BlockContent entities (empty, no field data) for any block placement config that references a non-existent block_content UUID.

CONFIG EXPORT:
- 14 block.block.shindo_*.yml placement configs reference block_content:UUID.
- All 14 UUIDs exist as BlockContent entities on ddev local (verified).
- cex added: recreate_block_content to core.extension, plus 3 new block placements that were on local but missing from config/sync: shindo_sidebar_welcome, shindo_sidebar_object_types, shindo_search.

